cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper."
title: "Interpretable Polarimetric Scattering Representation for PolSAR Ship Detection via Knowledge-Distillation-Guided Symbolic Regression"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a knowledge-distillation-guided symbolic-regression
  pipeline for PolSAR ship detection: a lightweight MLP teacher distils
  pixel-level hard labels into a continuous ship-membership surface, and an
  evolutionary symbolic-regression student fits a closed-form polarimetric
  descriptor under an explicit accuracy-complexity trade-off. The repository
  covers the six-node descriptor, the four-YOLO detector comparison, the
  operator and soft-label ablations, and the IPSD cross-sensor check with one
  scalar calibration.
